---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import profile from '../data/profile.json';
---
<Base title="关于我" page="about-page"><Header active="about" />
  <main id="main-content" class="page-main">
    <div class="about-intro"><div><p class="eyebrow">PLAYER 01 / BEHIND THE WORLDS</p><h1>玩家，<br />也是创造者<span>。</span></h1><p class="about-name">{profile.name} <span>{profile.alias}</span></p><p class="about-bio">{profile.bio}</p><div class="about-actions"><a class="primary-button" href={`mailto:${profile.email}`}>联系我 <span>↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href={profile.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub ↗</a><button class="text-link print-profile" type="button" hidden>打印 / 保存 PDF ↗</button></div></div><div class="about-identity" aria-hidden="true"><div class="identity-ring">C</div><span>PLAY. THINK. CREATE.</span></div></div>
    <div class="about-columns">
      <section><p class="eyebrow">01 / APPROACH</p><h2>从体验出发</h2><p>从玩家的视角理解关卡，再把设计意图落实到动线、白盒与可运行的游戏原型中。作品涵盖 Unreal Engine 关卡设计与开发、Blender 建模与程序化材质，以及对开放世界游戏的拆解。</p></section>
      <section><p class="eyebrow">02 / TOOLBOX</p><h2>持续学习，持续创作</h2><div class="skill-tags">{profile.tools.map(tool => <span>{tool}</span>)}</div><p>通过自主学习与项目实践积累虚幻引擎、Blender 和游戏设计经验。语言：{profile.languages.join('、')}。</p></section>
      <section><p class="eyebrow">03 / BACKGROUND</p><h2>{profile.education.school}</h2><p>{profile.education.department}<br />本科 · {profile.education.period}</p><p>兴趣：{profile.interests.join('、')}。</p></section>
    </div>
    <section class="contact-block"><p class="eyebrow">LET’S MAKE SOMETHING PLAYABLE</p><h2>下一个世界，<br />从一次对话开始。</h2><a href={`mailto:${profile.email}`}>{profile.email} <span>↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="/works/">查看我的作品 →</a></section>
  </main><Footer />
  <script>const printButton = document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('.print-profile'); if (printButton) { printButton.hidden = false; printButton.addEventListener('click', () => window.print()); }</script>
</Base>
